 And... For $\textbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} -10 \\ 6 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\textbf{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 15 \\ -9 \end{pmatrix}$, compute $\text{proj}_{\textbf{w}} \textbf{v}$. 
