Answer: $$\begin{align}
V
&=\pi\int_0^\pi y^2 \;\;dx\\
&= \pi\int_0^\pi \sin^2 x\;\; dx\\
&= \frac 12 \pi\int_0^\pi 1-\cos 2x\;\; dx\\
&=\frac 12 \pi \left[x-\frac{\sin 2x}2\right]_0^\pi\\
&=\color{red}{\frac {\;\pi^2}2}
\end{align}$$ 
