-\,{1 \over 4n^{2}}\int_{0}^{1}{\ln\pars{1 + x}\ln\pars{x} \over x}\,\dd x
\\[5mm]= &\
-\,{1 \over 4n^{2}}\int_{0}^{-1}{\ln\pars{1 - x}\ln\pars{-x} \over x}\,\dd x =
{1 \over 4n^{2}}\int_{0}^{-1}\mrm{Li}_{2}'\pars{x}\ln\pars{-x}\,\dd x =
