 integrate (H_x)^2 dx, from x=0 to x=1 
 in  Wolfram alpha online calculator , where as you see  $H_x$  is a generalized harmonic number, tell us that holds  $$\int_0^1 \left(H_x\right)^2 dx\approx 0.413172.$$ 
